- [x] T6.5 Show "Start Game" button **only** when `isHost`
- [x] T6.6 Disable "Start Game" (and show hint) when `isHost && participants.length < 2`
- [x] T6.7 Remove manual "Refresh Room" button (replaced by automatic polling)
- [x] T6.8 Show non-blocking poll error status (does not unmount Lobby)

### Phase 7: Frontend — Tests
